OL,3,GNEWSA'Microsoft outage put patients in
OL,4,Aa bad situation'
OL,5,
OL,6,FFrom schools and councils to doctors'
OL,7,Fsurgeries and criminal courts, just
OL,8,Fabout everything and everyone was
OL,9,Faffected by the global Microsoft outage
OL,10,Fin some way.
OL,12,FThe problems hit users of Microsoft 365
OL,13,FServices like Teams and Outlook, as
OL,14,Fwell as the firm's artificial
OL,15,Fintelligence software, Copilot.
OL,17,FBy Friday afternoon the tech company,
OL,18,Freported "sustained improvements". It
OL,19,Fsaid the issue was not caused by a
OL,20,Fcyber-security incident but by a
OL,21,Fhigher-than-usual stress on its
OL,22,Fservers.
